# ---- added 2026-11-11 for the codex-review loop --------------------------
# codex-review sends every untracked, non-ignored file to the reviewer in
# full, so anything not excluded here becomes review input.
# SLURM / tool logs (the old `*_%j.out` pattern was literal and matched nothing)
*.out
*.err
*.log
# shard outputs, raw hits, blast databases, GenBank conversions
*.raw
*.raw7
*.tsv
!config/**/*.tsv
!tests/**/*.tsv
*.gbk
*.nhr
*.nin
*.nsq
*.ndb
*.not
*.ntf
*.nto
*.njs
*.nog
*.nal
*.nos
# bundles and local data (insertion_record_format_v1_bundle.zip: user decision, ignore)
*.zip
reference/
# local tooling state, and previous review outputs
.claude/worktrees/
.review/
